// AWS IAM Inline Policy Added to User  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects addition of an inline policy to an IAM user (PutUserPolicy). Inline policies are easy to overlook in reviews, making them…
// False positives: Legitimate fine-grained permission grants.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-put-user-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="PutUserPolicy" and eventSource=="iam.amazonaws.com"
